# EXECUTE — 7.6: Cloud Functions — Quiet Hours + FCM Push

## Step 1 — functions/ infrastruttura
cmd: mkdir functions/src
cmd: Write functions/package.json → node 20, firebase-admin, firebase-functions v5
cmd: Write functions/tsconfig.json → TypeScript strict, outDir=lib, target ES2020
cmd: Write functions/.eslintrc.js → eslint + @typescript-eslint config
result: OK

## Step 2 — functions/src/index.ts
cmd: Write → `scheduledMedicationReminder` onSchedule ogni 15min (Europe/Rome):
     - collectionGroup query therapies isActive=true
     - per ciascuna: dosi nella finestra 30min
     - per ciascun membro: leggi quietHoursStart/End, se in quiet hours → skip
     - invia FCM a tutti i fcmTokens del membro
result: OK

## Step 3 — firebase.json
cmd: Edit → aggiunta sezione "functions": { "source": "functions", "runtime": "nodejs20" }
result: OK

## Deploy
Deploy: requires-human-action
```
cd functions && npm install && npm run build
firebase deploy --only functions
```
Prerequisito: Firebase Blaze plan (Cloud Functions richiede billing abilitato)

